    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d204">

                <pb facs="0195" n="121" xml:id="pg121"/>

                <head>Mr. F. W. Seward to Mr. Burnley</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-04-08"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 8, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 5th instant, in which, in conformity with instructions you
                    have received from her Majesty’s government, you express a hope that no obstacle
                    will be interposed to prevent British subjects from establishing their just
                    claim to that portion of the cotton captured at Savannah alleged to be their
                    property. In reply, I have the honor to state that, so far from desiring any
                    interposition of the character referred to, the United States government has
                    sought to give to all such claims as full a hearing and as just a consideration
                    as, under similar circumstances, they would expect to be accorded to like claims
                    of its own citizens.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD, By F. W. SEWARD, <hi rendition="#italic">Assistant
                            Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>J. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hume Burnley,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
